Async (fire independently)





















































EventWhenFileChangedWatched files changeCwdChangedWorking directory changesConfigChangeConfiguration changesInstructionsLoadedInstruction files loadNotificationClaude Code sends a notificationSubagentStart / SubagentStopSubagent spawns / finishesTaskCreated / TaskCompletedTask lifecycleWorktreeCreate / WorktreeRemoveWorktree lifecyclePreCompact / PostCompactContext compactionTeammateIdleAgent team teammate is idleElicitation / ElicitationResultMCP user input requests

Configuration Structure
Hooks live in Claude Code Settings under &quot;hooks&quot;:
{
  &quot;hooks&quot;: {
    &quot;EventName&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;tool_name|pattern|*&quot;,
        &quot;hooks&quot;: [
          {
            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;command&quot;,
            &quot;command&quot;: &quot;script.sh&quot;,
            &quot;if&quot;: &quot;Bash(rm *)&quot;,
            &quot;timeout&quot;: 600,
            &quot;statusMessage&quot;: &quot;Validating...&quot;,
            &quot;once&quot;: false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
Matcher Patterns

























