ToolName(glob-pattern)

Examples:
&quot;Bash(npm run test *)&quot;     // Allow npm test commands
&quot;Bash(git *)&quot;              // Allow all git commands
&quot;Read(~/.zshrc)&quot;           // Allow reading a specific file
&quot;WebFetch(*)&quot;              // Allow all web fetches
Pre-Approving for Autonomous Work
When spawning parallel workers or routines, pre-approve their common operations to avoid permission prompts:
{
  &quot;permissions&quot;: {
    &quot;allow&quot;: [
      &quot;Bash(npm run test *)&quot;,
      &quot;Bash(git add *)&quot;,
      &quot;Bash(git commit *)&quot;,
      &quot;Bash(git push *)&quot;,
      &quot;Bash(gh pr create *)&quot;
    ]
  }
}

Key Settings













































